    previousLevel: 9
    accessScore: 80
    inCampaign: 1
    chapterOpen: 1
    id: level_10
    title: Bridge Balance Challenge
    description: "Balance two voltage dividers on a 5 V supply. Replace the upper-right
      resistor with 100 \u03A9 until the LCD measures approximately 0.00 V between
      their midpoint nodes."
    conditions: Complete all configured objectives. A closed return path is required.
      Source shorts block completion. Target shorts block completion.
    sourceGuid: 794004c63cb1b9643b5389bd22d9a311
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_01/Level_10_Layout/Level_10.asset
