      Resistor_220_Input and Resistor_220_Output. Conduction required.
    - "Right Midpoint Voltage. R4 lower-right voltage must be 2.90 to 3.10 V. voltage
      \u2265 2.9 V. voltage \u2264 3.1 V. Connection pair Resistor_150_Input and
      Resistor_150_Output. Conduction required."
    - "Right Branch Current. R4 current must be 19 to 21 mA. current \u2265 19 mA.
      current \u2264 21 mA. Connection pair Resistor_150_Input and Resistor_150_Output.
      Conduction required."
    - "Total Bridge Current. Power source current must be 28 to 30 mA. current \u2265
      28 mA. current \u2264 30 mA. Connection pair Battery_positive and Battery_negative.
      Conduction required."
