  - levelNumber: 11
    chapterNumber: 1
    previousLevel: 10
    accessScore: 80
    inCampaign: 1
    chapterOpen: 1
    id: level_11
    title: Power Distribution Challenge
    description: Restore a safe 5 V three-branch parallel power network. Replace
      the overloaded 100 ohm R2 with 220 ohm; verify approximately 22.73 mA through
      R2, 5.00 V across R2, and 48.52 mA total source current. Turn the switch off
      before replacing resistors.
    conditions: Complete all configured objectives. A closed return path is required.
      Source shorts block completion. Target shorts block completion.
    sourceGuid: 75dca85951b518543a34f15d67e5654f
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_02/Level_11_Layout/Level_11.asset
    chapter: Electrical Foundations
    accessRule: Open
    layoutPath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_02/Level_11_Layout/Level_11_Layout.prefab
    objectives:
    - R1 Branch Conducting. Fixed 330 ohm R1 branch must conduct. Connection pair
      Resistor_330_Input and Resistor_330_Output. Conduction required.
    - "R2 Current Controlled. Replace 100 ohm R2 with 220 ohm so branch current is
      21-24 mA. current \u2265 21 mA. current \u2264 24 mA. Connection pair R2_Input
      and R2_Output. Conduction required."
    - "R2 Supply Voltage. R2 has 4.90-5.10 V across it. voltage \u2265 4.9 V. voltage
      \u2264 5.1 V. Connection pair R2_Input and R2_Output. Conduction required."
    - "Total Current Safe. Source current should be 47-50 mA with 330, 220 and 470
      ohm parallel branches. current \u2265 47 mA. current \u2264 50 mA. Connection
      pair Battery_positive and Battery_negative."
    equipment: []
    concepts:
    - Closed path
    - Ohm law
    teachingResources: []
    targets:
    - id: distribution_r1_conducting
      title: R1 Branch Conducting
      description: Fixed 330 ohm R1 branch must conduct.
      kind: ComponentConducting
      componentId: "Resistor_330_\u03A9"
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: Resistor_330_Input
      negativeId: Resistor_330_Output
    - id: distribution_r2_current
      title: R2 Current Controlled
      description: Replace 100 ohm R2 with 220 ohm so branch current is 21-24 mA.
      kind: CurrentRange
      componentId: R2_Component
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: R2_Input
      negativeId: R2_Output
    - id: distribution_r2_voltage
      title: R2 Supply Voltage
      description: R2 has 4.90-5.10 V across it.
      kind: VoltageRange
      componentId: R2_Component
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: R2_Input
      negativeId: R2_Output
    - id: distribution_source_current
      title: Total Current Safe
      description: Source current should be 47-50 mA with 330, 220 and 470 ohm parallel
        branches.
      kind: CurrentRange
      componentId: PowerSupply_01
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: Battery_positive
      negativeId: Battery_negative
