      R2 is in series with 470 ohm R3. current \u2265 7 mA. current \u2264 7.5 mA.
      Connection pair R2_Input and R2_Output. Conduction required."
    - "R3 Divided Voltage. Fixed 470 ohm R3 must have 3.30-3.50 V across it. voltage
      \u2265 3.3 V. voltage \u2264 3.5 V. Connection pair Resistor_470_Input and
      Resistor_470_Output. Conduction required."
    - "Safe Total Source Current. The source must supply 21.5-23.0 mA with 330 ohm
      parallel to the 220+470 ohm series branch. current \u2265 21.5 mA. current
      \u2264 23 mA. Connection pair Battery_positive and Battery_negative."
