    objectives:
    - Red LED Conducting. Red SparkLED must be forward biased and conducting; fixed
      binding ID led. Connection pair LED_Anode and LED_Cathode. Conduction required.
    - Green LED Conducting. Green SparkLED must be forward biased and conducting;
      fixed binding ID led_2. Connection pair led_2_Anode and led_2_Cathode. Conduction
      required.
    - "Correct Series Current. Install 100 ohm R_LIMIT; expect 8-12 mA through both
      LEDs in series (nominal). current \u2265 8 mA. current \u2264 12 mA. Connection
      pair Register_100_Input and Register_100_Output. Conduction required."
    - "Correct Resistor Voltage. Voltage across 100 ohm current limiter should be
      0.8-1.2 V (nominal). voltage \u2265 0.8 V. voltage \u2264 1.2 V. Connection
      pair Register_100_Input and Register_100_Output. Conduction required."
    - "Correct Supply Current. Single series-loop source current should be 8-12 mA
      (nominal). current \u2265 8 mA. current \u2264 12 mA. Connection pair Battery_positive
      and Battery_negative."
