    description: 'From a switched 5 V supply, install a 100 ohm series resistor in
      Register_Slot_2. After this resistor split into two parallel branches: 330
      ohm + red LED, and 470 ohm + green LED. Reconnect both LED cathodes to supply
      negative. Check both LEDs, each branch current, and source current. Power off
      before replacing the initial 220 ohm resistor. Current thresholds are nominal
      and must be checked against the actual SparkLED solver.'
    conditions: Complete all configured objectives. A closed return path is required.
      Source shorts block completion. Target shorts block completion.
