      LED_Anode and LED_Cathode. Conduction required.
    - Green LED Conducting. Green LED in the 470 ohm branch conducts. Connection
      pair led_2_Anode and led_2_Cathode. Conduction required.
    - "Red Branch Current. Nominal 330 ohm branch current; tune to actual LED model.
      current \u2265 4.5 mA. current \u2264 7.5 mA. Connection pair R_RED_Input and
