  - levelNumber: 18
    chapterNumber: 1
    previousLevel: 17
    accessScore: 80
    inCampaign: 1
    chapterOpen: 1
    id: level_18
    title: Precision Voltage Divider
    description: From a 5 V switched DC source, build a series voltage divider with
      a 330 ohm TOP resistor and a 470 ohm BOTTOM resistor. Connect supply positive
      through the switch and TOP resistor to VOUT, then through the BOTTOM resistor
      to supply negative. Measure VOUT relative to negative (~2.94 V), confirm the
      voltage across each resistor, and confirm equal series currents (~6.25 mA).
      Power off before changing components. Nominal thresholds should be verified
      with the Project Spark solver.
    conditions: Complete all configured objectives. A closed return path is required.
      Source shorts block completion. Target shorts block completion.
    sourceGuid: a67073b969181e143bc30359baadb0e3
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_02/Level_18_Layout/Level_18.asset
    chapter: Electrical Foundations
    accessRule: Open
    layoutPath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_02/Level_18_Layout/Level_18_Layout.prefab
    objectives:
    - "Output Voltage ~2.94 V. Voltage across BOTTOM 470 ohm resistor; equivalent
      to VOUT versus supply negative when properly wired. voltage \u2265 2.8 V. voltage
      \u2264 3.1 V. Connection pair R_BOTTOM_Input and R_BOTTOM_Output."
    - "TOP Resistor Voltage ~2.06 V. Voltage across TOP 330 ohm resistor. voltage
      \u2265 1.95 V. voltage \u2264 2.2 V. Connection pair R_TOP_Input and R_TOP_Output."
    - "TOP Series Current ~6.25 mA. Current through 330 ohm TOP resistor. current
      \u2265 5.8 mA. current \u2264 6.7 mA. Connection pair R_TOP_Input and R_TOP_Output.
      Conduction required."
    - "BOTTOM Series Current ~6.25 mA. Current through 470 ohm BOTTOM resistor. current
      \u2265 5.8 mA. current \u2264 6.7 mA. Connection pair R_BOTTOM_Input and R_BOTTOM_Output.
      Conduction required."
    - "Source Current ~6.25 mA. Total DC source current while voltage divider is
      connected. current \u2265 5.8 mA. current \u2264 6.7 mA. Connection pair Battery_positive
      and Battery_negative."
    equipment: []
    concepts:
    - Closed path
    - Ohm law
    - Measurement
    teachingResources: []
    targets:
    - id: level18_output_voltage
      title: Output Voltage ~2.94 V
      description: Voltage across BOTTOM 470 ohm resistor; equivalent to VOUT versus
        supply negative when properly wired.
      kind: VoltageRange
      componentId: R_BOTTOM_Component
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: R_BOTTOM_Input
      negativeId: R_BOTTOM_Output
    - id: level18_top_voltage
      title: TOP Resistor Voltage ~2.06 V
      description: Voltage across TOP 330 ohm resistor.
      kind: VoltageRange
      componentId: R_TOP_Component
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: R_TOP_Input
      negativeId: R_TOP_Output
