    objectives:
    - "Loaded Output Voltage ~2.46 V. Voltage across 470 ohm BOTTOM resistor, equivalent
      to VOUT versus ground. voltage \u2265 2.35 V. voltage \u2264 2.57 V. Connection
      pair R_BOTTOM_Input and R_BOTTOM_Output."
    - "TOP Resistor Current ~7.70 mA. Total current through 330 ohm TOP resistor.
      current \u2265 7.2 mA. current \u2264 8.2 mA. Connection pair R_TOP_Input and
      R_TOP_Output. Conduction required."
    - "BOTTOM Resistor Current ~5.24 mA. Current through the 470 ohm BOTTOM branch.
      current \u2265 4.9 mA. current \u2264 5.6 mA. Connection pair R_BOTTOM_Input
      and R_BOTTOM_Output. Conduction required."
    - "LOAD Resistor Current ~2.46 mA. Current through the 1 kohm LOAD branch in
      parallel with the BOTTOM resistor. current \u2265 2.2 mA. current \u2264 2.8
      mA. Connection pair R_LOAD_Input and R_LOAD_Output. Conduction required."
    - "Total Source Current ~7.70 mA. Source current equals the TOP current, approximately
      the sum of BOTTOM and LOAD branch currents. current \u2265 7.2 mA. current
      \u2264 8.2 mA. Connection pair Battery_positive and Battery_negative."
