  - levelNumber: 20
    chapterNumber: 1
    previousLevel: 19
    accessScore: 80
    inCampaign: 1
    chapterOpen: 1
    id: level_20
    title: Wheatstone Bridge Balance
    description: 'From a switched 5 V supply, build two parallel voltage dividers:
      LEFT 330 ohm TOP and 470 ohm BOTTOM, RIGHT 330 ohm TOP and 470 ohm BOTTOM.
      The RIGHT TOP workstation initially has an incorrect 220 ohm resistor; power
      off, replace it with 330 ohm, and wire both branches to the common supply positive
      and negative. Measure the difference between MID A (left midpoint) and MID
      B (right midpoint) using LCD Terminals A and B, not a conducting wire. Balance
      requires near-zero midpoint difference, both midpoint voltages near 2.94 V,
      two branch currents near 6.25 mA, and total source current near 12.5 mA. Verify
      values against the Project Spark solver.'
    conditions: Complete all configured objectives. A closed return path is required.
      Source shorts block completion. Target shorts block completion.
    sourceGuid: 3e519535634e7db4fbda3ed1044e16f6
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_02/Level_20_Layout/Level_20.asset
    chapter: Electrical Foundations
    accessRule: Open
    layoutPath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_02/Level_20_Layout/Level_20_Layout.prefab
    objectives:
    - "Bridge Balance (MID A - MID B). Measure the magnitude of voltage between the
      two divider midpoints; keep below 0.05 V. voltage \u2264 0.05 V. Connection
      pair R_LBOTTOM_Input and R_RBOTTOM_Input."
    - "LEFT Midpoint Voltage ~2.94 V. LEFT midpoint MID A relative to source negative;
      voltage across left lower 470 ohm resistor. voltage \u2265 2.8 V. voltage \u2264
      3.1 V. Connection pair R_LBOTTOM_Input and R_LBOTTOM_Output."
    - "LEFT Branch Current ~6.25 mA. Current through left TOP 330 ohm resistor. current
      \u2265 5.8 mA. current \u2264 6.7 mA. Connection pair R_LTOP_Input and R_LTOP_Output.
      Conduction required."
    - "RIGHT Branch Current ~6.25 mA. Current through right TOP resistor; requires
      replacing the initial 220 ohm part. current \u2265 5.8 mA. current \u2264 6.7
      mA. Connection pair R_RTOP_Input and R_RTOP_Output. Conduction required."
    - "Source Current ~12.5 mA. Total source current is the sum of the two divider
      branch currents. current \u2265 11.8 mA. current \u2264 13.2 mA. Connection
      pair Battery_positive and Battery_negative."
    equipment: []
    concepts:
    - Ohm law
    - Measurement
    teachingResources: []
    targets:
    - id: level20_bridge_balance
      title: Bridge Balance (MID A - MID B)
      description: Measure the magnitude of voltage between the two divider midpoints;
        keep below 0.05 V.
      kind: VoltageRange
      componentId: R_LBOTTOM_Component
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: R_LBOTTOM_Input
      negativeId: R_RBOTTOM_Input
    - id: level20_midpoint_voltage
      title: LEFT Midpoint Voltage ~2.94 V
      description: LEFT midpoint MID A relative to source negative; voltage across
        left lower 470 ohm resistor.
      kind: VoltageRange
      componentId: R_LBOTTOM_Component
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: R_LBOTTOM_Input
      negativeId: R_LBOTTOM_Output
    - id: level20_left_current
      title: LEFT Branch Current ~6.25 mA
      description: Current through left TOP 330 ohm resistor.
      kind: CurrentRange
      componentId: R_LTOP_Component
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: R_LTOP_Input
      negativeId: R_LTOP_Output
    - id: level20_right_current
      title: RIGHT Branch Current ~6.25 mA
      description: Current through right TOP resistor; requires replacing the initial
        220 ohm part.
      kind: CurrentRange
      componentId: R_RTOP_Component
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: R_RTOP_Input
      negativeId: R_RTOP_Output
    - id: level20_source_current
      title: Source Current ~12.5 mA
      description: Total source current is the sum of the two divider branch currents.
      kind: CurrentRange
      componentId: PowerSupply_01
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: Battery_positive
      negativeId: Battery_negative
  - levelNumber: 21
