    id: level_21
    title: Capacitor Charge - Store the Energy
    description: Build a 5 V RC charging circuit with a 1 kOhm resistor and 1000
      uF capacitor. Charge the capacitor near 5 V and verify that the charging resistor
      voltage drop settles near zero.
    conditions: Complete all configured objectives. Source shorts block completion.
      Target shorts block completion. Required installed resistors must be healthy.
    sourceGuid: c708ffba3a0f40b498e534c36a0b1e16
