      5.2 V. Connection pair Battery_positive and Battery_negative."
    - "Capacitor Charged. Verify the capacitor has charged to at least 95% of the
      5 V supply. voltage \u2265 4.75 V. voltage \u2264 5.1 V. Connection pair C_STORE_Input
      and C_STORE_Output."
    - "Charging Resistor Settled. Verify the voltage drop across the charging resistor
      has fallen near zero after the capacitor charges. voltage \u2264 0.25 V. Connection
