    id: level_26
    title: Bridge Defender - Four Diode Rectifier
    description: Build a 5 V DC four-diode bridge rectifier. Forward diodes D1 and
      D4 deliver current through a 220 ohm resistor and green LED while D2 and D3
      block. Verify bridge polarity, safe series current and the illuminated LED.
    conditions: Complete all configured objectives. A closed return path is required.
      Source shorts block completion. Target shorts block completion. Required installed
      resistors must be healthy.
    sourceGuid: 4b48503581b02294c8ef750ebf53c660
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_03/Level_26_Layout/Level_26.asset
    chapter: Electronic Components
