    layoutPath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_03/Level_26_Layout/Level_26_Layout.prefab
    objectives:
    - "5 V Bridge Supply. Verify the 5 V source before bridge rectification. voltage
      \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V. Connection pair Battery_positive and Battery_negative."
    - "D1 Forward Bridge Diode. Verify D1 has a forward voltage drop for normal DC
      input polarity. voltage \u2265 0.45 V. voltage \u2264 1 V. Connection pair
      D_BRIDGE_1_Anode and D_BRIDGE_1_Cathode."
    - "D4 Forward Return Diode. Verify D4 conducts in the return path to the supply
      negative terminal. voltage \u2265 0.45 V. voltage \u2264 1 V. Connection pair
      D_BRIDGE_4_Anode and D_BRIDGE_4_Cathode."
    - Bridge Output Green LED ON. Verify the LED illuminates with correct bridge
      output polarity. Connection pair LED_Anode and LED_Cathode.
    - "Safe Bridge Load Current. Verify 6 to 9 mA through the 220 ohm load resistor.
      current \u2265 6 mA. current \u2264 9 mA. Connection pair R_LIMIT_Input and
      R_LIMIT_Output."
    - "220 Ohm Resistor Voltage. Verify a drop of 1.3 to 1.9 V across the 220 ohm
      resistor. voltage \u2265 1.3 V. voltage \u2264 1.9 V. Connection pair R_LIMIT_Input
      and R_LIMIT_Output."
    equipment: []
    concepts:
    - Closed path
    - Ohm law
    - Polarity
