    - Calibrate protected power and sensors. Confirm the protected input, all regulated
      rails, fresh W075 validity and agreeing voltage/current readings.
    - Qualify three load-transient profiles. Capture native voltage and current through
      rising, falling and repeated pulses.
    - Diagnose and repair ESR, via and Kelvin faults. Measure three injected circuit
      faults, repair their physical targets and qualify each on new samples.
    - Prove W075 recovery. Verify W075 inhibition, physically reconnect, recalibrate,
      reset U9 and run a fresh scope capture.
