    layoutPath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Level_106_Layout/Level_106_Layout.prefab
    objectives:
    - Install 106 components. Close all correctly fitted assembly contacts.
    - Route 140 traces and plate 42 vias. Solve continuity across seven service domains
      and link W141.
    - Commission CPU power and DDR4. Verify rails, reset timing and four DDR4 lanes.
    - Complete POST and first boot. Verify firmware, PCIe and eMMC handoff.
    - Diagnose and repair three boot failures. Reproduce the faults, repair their
