    title: The Silicon Workshop
    description: Service the factory-populated DDR5 board, isolate three hardware
      faults and prove thermal protection before reboot.
    conditions: Complete all configured objectives. Source shorts block completion.
      Target shorts block completion.
    sourceGuid: 89d106ff06959ad4d9efe4b7259b57f7
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Level_129_Layout/Level_129.asset
