    accessRule: CompletePreviousChapter
    layoutPath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Level_129_Layout/Level_129_Layout.prefab
    objectives:
    - Complete keyed service assembly. Lock the CPU, cross-mount the cooler, latch
      both memory modules and secure the workshop drive.
    - Qualify all loaded rails. Verify standby before main power, then measure EPS,
      core, I/O and memory under load.
    - Verify CPU and dual-channel DDR5 POST. Check CPU, both memory channels, video
      and storage through a fresh diagnostic sequence.
    - Qualify eight interfaces. Select valid fixture modes for both PCIe slots, M.2,
      SATA, HDMI, VGA, USB and LAN.
    - Diagnose and verify three hardware repairs. Isolate PQ04, DDR5_2 and M2_1 from
      native readings. Retest after every verified replacement.
    - Prove protection and complete a fresh reboot. Open the fan under load, verify
      shutdown, isolate and restore cooling, reset explicitly and requalify.
