  - levelNumber: 130
    chapterNumber: 13
    previousLevel: 129
    accessScore: 80
    inCampaign: 1
    chapterOpen: 0
    id: level_130
    title: The Recovery Lab
    description: Recover a DDR5 workshop PC with successive EPS, virtual ROM and
      fan-feedback faults, then pass the final cold-start audit.
    conditions: Complete all configured objectives. Source shorts block completion.
      Target shorts block completion.
    sourceGuid: f62763110b9c3694491e2b1993207f64
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Level_130_Layout/Level_130.asset
    chapter: Commercial Motherboards
    accessRule: CompletePreviousChapter
    layoutPath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Level_130_Layout/Level_130_Layout.prefab
    objectives:
    - Complete intake and service inventory. Inspect ten original landmarks and verify
      five keyed service modules.
    - Restore protected CPU power. Compare both sides of the EPS connector, isolate,
      reseat and verify fresh core measurements.
    - Recover the virtual ROM and cold POST. Capture both lab-ROM reads. Restore
      the correct fictional image under isolation, then repeat initialization.
    - Qualify memory, PCIe and NVMe. After a full restart, independently verify both
      memory channels, both PCIe links and NVMe block integrity.
    - Restore fan feedback and prove thermal protection. Show motor power with absent
      tach, prove the loaded cutoff, replace the matching spare and rerun thermal
      qualification.
    - Sign the final cold-start audit. After an isolated restart collect fresh power,
      POST, device and thermal evidence on the same boot.
    equipment: []
    concepts: []
    teachingResources: []
    targets:
    - id: l130_1
      title: Complete intake and service inventory
      description: Inspect ten original landmarks and verify five keyed service modules.
      kind: ComponentPowered
      componentId: L130_Proof_1
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: 
      negativeId: 
    - id: l130_2
      title: Restore protected CPU power
      description: Compare both sides of the EPS connector, isolate, reseat and verify
        fresh core measurements.
      kind: ComponentPowered
      componentId: L130_Proof_2
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: 
      negativeId: 
    - id: l130_3
      title: Recover the virtual ROM and cold POST
      description: Capture both lab-ROM reads. Restore the correct fictional image
        under isolation, then repeat initialization.
      kind: ComponentPowered
      componentId: L130_Proof_3
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: 
      negativeId: 
    - id: l130_4
      title: Qualify memory, PCIe and NVMe
      description: After a full restart, independently verify both memory channels,
        both PCIe links and NVMe block integrity.
      kind: ComponentPowered
      componentId: L130_Proof_4
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: 
      negativeId: 
    - id: l130_5
      title: Restore fan feedback and prove thermal protection
      description: Show motor power with absent tach, prove the loaded cutoff, replace
        the matching spare and rerun thermal qualification.
      kind: ComponentPowered
      componentId: L130_Proof_5
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: 
      negativeId: 
    - id: l130_6
      title: Sign the final cold-start audit
      description: After an isolated restart collect fresh power, POST, device and
        thermal evidence on the same boot.
      kind: ComponentPowered
      componentId: L130_Proof_6
      terminalId: 
      positiveId: 
      negativeId: 
