    guid: c09e0218e27e2b94fac0a1ec3ea6ab40
    path: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Level_111_Layout/Level_111.asset
    summary: Build the 14-layer SIX-19, commission four 10 Gb/s lanes, diagnose three
